final strategy.
10.2 Directive interpretation entry
Field Requirement
note_index Zero-based index of the corresponding operator_notes entry.
applies true for every applicable non-no_op directive; false
only for no_op.
directive_type One supported directive type from Section 04.
no_op is required when applies = false.
